Hello Managers,

Yes, I am still running this system - it's been running for a long,
long, long time (+8 years).  It needs minimal care and maintenance.  I
even bought an entire spare system just for parts from eBay for <$250.

Our network is FINALLY being upgraded.  Call me sentimental but I want
to keep this system on par with the other servers.

So, does anybody know what kind of gigabit UTP NIC will work on this
system?

BTW --- Any and all commentary about running older (I believe
"experienced" is the politically correct term.) systems is welcomed and
encouraged.

Thanks,

